# AGENTS.md (web package)

This package inherits all rules from the repository root `AGENTS.md`.

## Package Scope

Frontend application, UI components, and client integrations.

## Commands

```bash
{{packageManager}} --filter web run test
{{packageManager}} --filter web run build
```

## Notes

- Prefer component-level tests and snapshots where appropriate.
- Keep UI changes aligned with design systems.
